 IpcTraceTest.RunAndValidateEventCounts("," | Directory | Contents |"," |-----------|----------|"," | `common/` | Shared infrastructure (`IpcTraceTest`, `DiagnosticsClient`, helpers) |","+| `native/` | Native EventPipe and container unit tests, managed launchers, and shared native-test runner |"," | `eventsvalidation/` | Tests that validate specific event types and payloads |"," | `providervalidation/` | Tests that validate provider registration and event counts |"," | `rundownvalidation/` | Tests for rundown event correctness |"],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/tests/tracing/eventpipe/native/Directory.Build.props","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@","+<Project>","+  <!-- Native component tests use the root test build configuration instead of the managed tracing test configuration. -->","+  <Import Project=\"$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\\..\\..\\Directory.Build.props\" />","+  <PropertyGroup>","+    <RequiresProcessIsolation>true</RequiresProcessIsolation>","+    <CLRTestTargetUnsupported Condition=\"'$(TargetsMobile)' == 'true' or '$(TargetsWasm)' == 'true'\">true</CLRTestTargetUnsupported>","+  </PropertyGroup>","+  <ItemGroup>","+    <Compile Include=\"$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)common\\NativeTestProcess.cs\" />","+  </ItemGroup>","+</Project>"],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/tests/tracing/eventpipe/native/Directory.Build.targets","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@","+<Project>","+  <!-- Native component tests use the root test build configuration instead of the managed tracing test configuration. -->","+  <Import Project=\"$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)..\\..\\..\\Directory.Build.targets\" />","+","+  <Target Name=\"WriteNativeTestExecutableList\"","+          BeforeTargets=\"Build;CopyAllNativeProjectReferenceBinaries\"","+          Condition=\"'$(TargetOS)' != 'windows' and '@(CMakeProjectReference)' != ''\">","+    <PropertyGroup>","+      <_NativeTestDestDir>$(TargetDir)</_NativeTestDestDir>","+      <_NativeTestDestDir Condition=\"'$(_NativeTestDestDir)' == ''\">$(OutputPath)</_NativeTestDestDir>","+      <_NativeTestExecutable>$(MSBuildProjectName)Driver</_NativeTestExecutable>","+      <_NativeTestExecutableRelative Condition=\"'$(BuildProjectRelativeDir)' != ''\">$(BuildProjectRelativeDir)$(_NativeTestExecutable)</_NativeTestExecutableRelative>","+      <_NativeTestExecutableRelative Condition=\"'$(_NativeTestExecutableRelative)' == ''\">$([System.IO.Path]::GetRelativePath('$(TestBinDir)', '$(_NativeTestDestDir)$(_NativeTestExecutable)'))</_NativeTestExecutableRelative>","+    </PropertyGroup>","+    <!-- Helix deployment resets execute permissions; register the driver for the existing chmod step. -->","+    <WriteLinesToFile File=\"$(_NativeTestDestDir)helix-extra-executables.list\"","+                      Lines=\"$(_NativeTestExecutableRelative)\"","+                      Overwrite=\"true\"","+                      WriteOnlyWhenDifferent=\"true\" />","+  </Target>","+</Project>"],"additions":21,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/tests/tracing/eventpipe/native/common/NativeTestProcess.cs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,65 @@","+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.","+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.","+","+using System;","+using System.Diagnostics;","+using System.IO;","+using System.Threading.Tasks;","+","+internal static class NativeTestProcess","+{","+    internal static (int ExitCode, string Output, string Error) Run(string executable, params string[] arguments)","+    {","+        string baseDirectory = AppContext.BaseDirectory;","+        if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(baseDirectory))","+        {","+            baseDirectory = Environment.CurrentDirectory;","+        }","+        string directory = TestLibrary.Utilities.IsNativeAot","+            ? Path.Combine(baseDirectory, \"..\")","+            : baseDirectory;","+        string fileName = executable + (OperatingSystem.IsWindows() ? \".exe\" : \"\");","+        var startInfo = new ProcessStartInfo(Path.GetFullPath(Path.Combine(directory, fileName)))","+        {","+            RedirectStandardError = true,","+            RedirectStandardOutput = true,","+            UseShellExecute = false","+        };","+","+        foreach (string argument in arguments)","+        {","+            startInfo.ArgumentList.Add(argument);","+        }","+","+        DirectoryInfo workingDirectory = Directory.CreateTempSubdirectory(nameof(NativeTestProcess) + \"-\");","+        try","+        {","+            startInfo.WorkingDirectory = workingDirectory.FullName;","+            using Process process = Process.Start(startInfo);","+            try","+            {","+                Task<string> output = process.StandardOutput.ReadToEndAsync();","+                Task<string> error = process.StandardError.ReadToEndAsync();","+","+                if (!process.WaitForExit(60_000))","+                {","+                    throw new TimeoutException($\"Native test executable '{fileName}' did not exit within 60 seconds.\");","+                }","+","+                return (process.ExitCode, output.GetAwaiter().GetResult(), error.GetAwaiter().GetResult());","+            }","+            finally","+            {","+                if (!process.HasExited)","+                {","+                    process.Kill(entireProcessTree: true);","+                    process.WaitForExit();","+                }","+            }","+        }","+        finally","+        {","+            workingDirectory.Delete(recursive: true);","+        }","+    }","+}"],"additions":65,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/tests/tracing/eventpipe/native/common/driver.c","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,85 @@","+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.","+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.","+","+/*","+ * Derived from the EGLib Unit Test Driver.","+ * Copyright (C) 2006 Novell, Inc.","+ *","+ * Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining","+ * a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the","+ * \"Software\"), to deal in the Software without restriction, including","+ * without limitation the rights to use, copy, modify, merge, publish,","+ * distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software, and to","+ * permit persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so, subject to","+ * the following conditions:","+ *","+ * The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be","+ * included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.","+ *","+ * THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND,","+ * EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF","+ * MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND","+ * NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE","+ * LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION","+ * OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION","+ * WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.","+ */","+","+#include \"test.h\"","+","+#include <stdio.h>","+","+int run_tests_main(const Group *groups, int argc, char **argv)","+{","+    if (argc == 2 && (strcmp(argv[1], \"--list\") == 0 || strcmp(argv[1], \"--help\") == 0))","+    {","+        if (strcmp(argv[1], \"--help\") == 0)","+            printf(\"Usage: %s [--list | GROUP ...]\\n\", argv[0]);","+","+        for (const Group *group = groups; group->name != NULL; group++)","+            puts(group->name);","+","+        return EXIT_SUCCESS;","+    }","+","+    for (int i = 1; i < argc; i++)","+    {","+        bool found = false;","+        for (const Group *group = groups; group->name != NULL; group++)","+        {","+            if (strcmp(argv[i], group->name) == 0)","+            {","+                found = true;","+                break;","+            }","+        }","+","+        if (!found)","+        {","+            fprintf(stderr, \"Unknown test group '%s'. Use --list to list groups.\\n\", argv[i]);","+            return EXIT_FAILURE;","+        }","+    }","+","+    size_t passed = 0;","+    size_t total = 0;","+    bool success = true;","+    for (const Group *group = groups; group->name != NULL; group++)","+    {","+        bool selected = argc == 1;","+        for (int i = 1; i < argc && !selected; i++)","+            selected = strcmp(argv[i], group->name) == 0;","+","+        if (selected && !run_group(group, &passed, &total))","+            success = false;","+    }","+","+    if (total == 0)","+    {","+        fputs(\"No native tests executed.\\n\", stderr);","+        success = false;","+    }","+","+    printf(\"Overall result: %s : %zu / %zu\\n\", success ? \"OK\" : \"FAILED\", passed, total);","+    return success ? EXIT_SUCCESS : EXIT_FAILURE;","+}"],"additions":85,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/tests/tracing/eventpipe/native/common/test.c","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,105 @@","+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.","+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.","+","+/*","+ * Derived from the EGLib Unit Group/Test Runners.","+ * Copyright (C) 2006 Novell, Inc.","+ *","+ * Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining","+ * a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the","+ * \"Software\"), to deal in the Software without restriction, including","+ * without limitation the rights to use, copy, modify, merge, publish,","+ * distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software, and to","+ * permit persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so, subject to","+ * the following conditions:","+ *","+ * The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be","+ * included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.","+ *","+ * THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND,","+ * EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF","+ * MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND","+ * NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE","+ * LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION","+ * OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION","+ * WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.","+ */","+","+#include \"test.h\"","+","+#include <stdarg.h>","+#include <stdio.h>","+","+bool run_group(const Group *group, size_t *passed, size_t *total)","+{","+    size_t group_passed = 0;","+    size_t group_total = 0;","+","+    printf(\"[%s]\\n\", group->name);","+","+    for (const Test *test = group->handler(); test->name != NULL; test++)","+    {","+        printf(\"  %s: \", test->name);","+        fflush(stdout);","+        RESULT result = test->handler();","+        group_total++;","+","+        if (result == OK)","+        {","+            group_passed++;","+            printf(\"OK\\n\");","+        }","+        else","+        {","+            printf(\"FAILED (%s)\\n\", result);","+            free(result);","+        }","+    }","+","+    *passed += group_passed;","+    *total += group_total;","+    printf(\"  %zu / %zu\\n\", group_passed, group_total);","+","+    if (group_total == 0)","+    {","+        fprintf(stderr, \"No tests registered in group '%s'.\\n\", group->name);","+        return false;","+    }","+","+    return group_passed == group_total;","+}","+","+RESULT FAILED(const char *format, ...)","+{","+    va_list args;","+    va_start(args, format);","+    int length = vsnprintf(NULL, 0, format, args);","+    va_end(args);","+","+    if (length < 0)","+    {","+        fputs(\"Unable to format native test failure.\\n\", stderr);","+        abort();","+    }","+","+    size_t size = (size_t)length + 1;","+    char *result = malloc(size);","+    if (result == NULL)","+    {","+        fputs(\"Unable to allocate native test failure.\\n\", stderr);","+        abort();","+    }","+","+    va_start(args, format);","+    int written = vsnprintf(result, size, format, args);","+    va_end(args);","+","+    if (written != length)","+    {","+        fputs(\"Unable to format native test failure.\\n\", stderr);","+        free(result);","+        abort();","+    }","+","+    return result;","+}"],"additions":105,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/tests/tracing/eventpipe/native/common/test.h","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,65 @@","+// Licensed to the .NET Foundation under one or more agreements.","+// The .NET Foundation licenses this file to you under the MIT license.","+","+/*","+ * Derived from the EGLib Unit Group/Test Runners.","+ * Copyright (C) 2006 Novell, Inc.","+ *","+ * Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining","+ * a copy of this software and associated documentation files (the","+ * \"Software\"), to deal in the Software without restriction, including","+ * without limitation the rights to use, copy, modify, merge, publish,","+ * distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software, and to","+ * permit persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so, subject to","+ * the following conditions:","+ *","+ * The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be","+ * included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.","+ *","+ * THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND,","+ * EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF","+ * MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND","+ * NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE","+ * LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION","+ * OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION","+ * WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.","+ */","+","+#ifndef NATIVE_TEST_RUNNER_H","+#define NATIVE_TEST_RUNNER_H","+","+#include <stdbool.h>","+#include <stddef.h>",